## 2. Can We Filter by Store Type?

**Yes — and it is already possible right now.**

The `DataSourceName` from the CSV (the original store/channel identifier) was preserved in the `order_name` column as `"Historical import - {DataSourceName}"`.

### Current Store Types in Historical Data

| Store / Channel | DB `order_name` | Records Inserted |
